---
import AboutHeroImage from "../assets/blog-placeholder-about.jpg";
import Layout from "../layouts/BlogPost.astro";
import { Icon } from "astro-icon/components";
---

<Layout
	title="About Me"
	description="Who am I?"
	pubDate={new Date("August 26 2026")}
	heroImage={AboutHeroImage}
>
	<p>Watermelonabc 是……</p>
	<ul>
		<li>FZU 计科大三学生</li>
		<li>ROIS 团队 2024 级二进制方向正式成员</li>
		<li>Furry 控</li>
		<li>牢博士</li>
		<li>etc.</li>
	</ul>
	<p>通过以下渠道联系我：</p>
	<div class="social-links">
		<a href="https://github.com/rt265" target="_blank">
			<span class="sr-only">Go to Watermelonabc's GitHub profile</span>
			<Icon name="tabler:brand-github" />
		</a>
		<a href="mailto:2172718424@qq.com" target="_blank">
			<span class="sr-only">Go to Watermelonabc's email</span>
			<Icon name="tabler:mailbox" />
		</a>
	</div>
</Layout>
<style>
	.social-links,
	.social-links a {
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
		justify-content: center;
	}
	/* 社交图标链接：黑白配色，不跟随内容区链接样式 */
	.social-links a {
		color: rgb(var(--black));
		text-decoration: none;
		transition: color 0.2s ease;
	}
	/* hover 时跟随主题链接色 */
	.social-links a:hover {
		color: var(--link);
	}
	/* 增大图标间距 */
	.social-links {
		gap: 1.5em;
	}
	[data-icon] {
		width: 2em;
		height: 2em;
	}
</style>
